n Computer Application,</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 18.1486%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"96\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">2 Year</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8654%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">G</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.2171%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"205\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s325db67c5657914454081c6a18e93d6dd/uploads/2022/02/2022021068.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Other Group G Courses Details – Click Here</a></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 18.1486%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"96\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1 Year</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8654%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">H</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.2171%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"205\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Diploma in Hotel Management and Catering</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 18.1486%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"96\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3 Year</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8654%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">I</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.2171%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"205\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Diploma in Aircraft, Maintenance Engineering</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 18.1486%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"96\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3 Year</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8654%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">I</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.2171%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"205\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Diploma in Aircraft, Maintenance Engineering (Avionics)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 18.1486%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"96\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3 Year</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8654%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">J</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.2171%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"205\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PG Diploma in Information Technology</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 18.1486%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"96\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1 Year</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8654%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">K</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.2171%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"205\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Diploma in Engineering (Lateral Entry)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 18.1486%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"96\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">2 Year</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 14.8654%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">L</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.2171%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"205\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Post Diploma in Industry Safety</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 18.1486%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"96\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1 Year</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP Polytechnic JEECUP Online Form 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Course Name</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Eligibility</b></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Diploma in Engineering</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed Class 10 High School with 35% Marks, PCM 50% Marks will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Diploma in Agriculture Engineering</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed Class 10 High School with Agriculture Subject, PCM &amp; Agriculture 50% Marks will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fashion Designing and Garments Technology</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed Class 10 High School with 35% Marks will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Home Science</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed Class 10 High School with 35% Marks will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Textile Design</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed Class 10 High School with 35% Marks will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Textile Design (Printing)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed Class 10 High School with 35% Marks will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Modern Officer Management and Secretarial Service</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed 10+2 (Intermediate) Exam with Hindi and English Subject in High School and Intermediate Level Exam will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Library and Information Science</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed Class 10+2 (Intermediate) Exam will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Diploma in Pharmacy</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed Class 10+2 Exam in Science Stream with 50% Marks will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PG Diploma in Biotechnology</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have B.Sc. Degree in Biology, Chemistry or Bio Chemistry Subjects will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PG Diploma in Computer Application</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have Bachelor Degree in Any Stream in Any Recognized University in India will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PG Diploma in Marketing and Sales Management, PG Diploma in Customer One Year Service Management </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have Bachelor Degree in Any Stream in Any Recognized University in India&nbsp;will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PG Diploma in Tourism and Travel Management, Beauty and Health Care, Advertising and Public Relation, Textile Design, Fashion Technology</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have Bachelor Degree in Any Stream in Any Recognized University in India will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PG Diploma in&nbsp; Mass Communication, Computer Hardware and Networking, Web Designing, Accountancy with Computerized Account and Taxation, Retail Management</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have Bachelor Degree in Any Stream in Any Recognized University in India will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Diploma in Hotel Management and Catering</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed Class 10+2 Exam (Intermediate) with 50% Marks will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Diploma in Aircraft, Maintenance Engineering</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed Class 10+2 Exam (Intermediate) with PCM Group Subjects with 50% Marks in Physics or Chemistry Subjects will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Diploma in Aircraft, Maintenance Engineering (Avionics) </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed Class 10+2 Exam (Intermediate) with PCM Group Subjects with 50% Marks in Physics or Chemistry Subjects will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PG Diploma in Information Technology</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have Diploma in Engineering (Any Branch) will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Diploma in Engineering (Lateral Entry)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed Class 10+2 Exam with Science Stream or Class 10 Exam with ITI Certificate will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9426%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Post Diploma in Industry Safety</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0574%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have BE / B.Tech Degree in Any Stream with 2 Year Experience OR Diploma in Engineering with 5 Year Experience will be eligible for admission in this course.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download UP Polytechnic JEECUP Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In order to download their UP Polytechnic JEECUP Answer Key 2026, Candidates need to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their UP Polytechnic JEECUP Answer Key 2026.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates will be redirected to Login Page, Here they have to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration No. / Login ID / Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Password / DOB</strong></span></li>\n<li s